-Tablet-sync and review-export are not yet designed. Their contracts depend on the concurrency mechanism selected here. Neither the HLD nor the catalog contract selects that mechanism.
+The store preserves every accepted submission as an immutable whole-visit revision. Independent edits therefore remain intact for human comparison rather than being combined according to field-level rules. This increases coordinator review work, but avoids silently crossing scientific relationships between fields.
 
-## Architecture
