+| Field | Meaning |
+|---|---|
+| `revisionId` | Server-generated UUID, stable for the lifetime of the revision |
+| `visitId` | Client-generated UUID shared by every revision of the visit |
+| `baseRevisionId` | Revision the worker edited, or `null` for an initial visit submission |
+| `payload` | Complete observation date, observer list, species cover estimates, notes, and catalog plot UUID |
